      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/85-harbour-view-road-knocknaheeny-cork-t23-y3y5\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 85 Harbour View Road, Knocknaheeny.\r\n\r\nNestled in the vibrant community of Knocknaheeny, this is an impressive end-of-terrace property boasting both comfort and convenience. This three-bedroom residence presents a handsome exterior punctuated by a classic facade with a tidy front lawn that enhances its kerb appeal. A pathway leads you directly to the front door, making for a warm and inviting entrance.\r\n\r\nAs you enter the property, the ground floor unfolds into a spacious and light-filled reception room. The room features a large window that allows ample natural light to pour in, creating an airy atmosphere. Adjacent to the living area, the kitchen is practical and well-designed, with sufficient counter space and room for a dining table, perfectly accommodating family meals or casual gatherings.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the three bedrooms are all generously proportioned. The master bedroom is particularly noteworthy, featuring ample space and natural lighting from a large window. The additional bedrooms are ideal for children or as guest accommodations. Also located on this floor is a well-appointed family bathroom.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a private garden to the rear, offering a tranquil space for outdoor leisure or gardening enthusiasts.\r\n\r\nThe location is superb, providing easy access to local amenities including schools, shops, and sports clubs, all within a short distance. Transport links are advantageous, with nearby bus stops providing regular service to Cork city centre and beyond, ideal for those commuting to work or seeking city life without the hustle and bustle.\r\n\r\nThe property is perfect for first-time buyers looking for a charming start, families needing more space, or investors seeking a promising venture. Its strategic location and distinctive features offer a practical and promising home in a thriving community."
